              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kwaku akeethĩwa mũtũngĩĩi wa thayũ, na mũei wa ũkũu waku; nũndũ mũka wa mwana waku, ũla ũkwendete, ũla mũseo kwaku kũvĩtũka ana mũonza, nĩwamũsyaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.15",
